          "html": "Head to <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Pollnivneach\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Pollnivneach</a>. You can use the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Magic_carpet\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">magic carpet</a> network from <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Shantay_Pass\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Shantay Pass</a> or <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Al_Kharid_lodestone\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Al Kharid lodestone</a> to travel to <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Al_Kharid\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Al Kharid</a> and head south-east or Teleport to your player owned house and exit via Pollniveach.",
